      "summaryZh": "谷歌DeepMind发布了Antigravity 2.0，这是其AI平台的一次重大更新，引入了新的推理能力和多模态支持。该版本旨在提升复杂任务处理的效率和准确性。",
      "summaryEn": "Google DeepMind has released Antigravity 2.0, a major update to its AI platform, introducing new reasoning capabilities and multimodal support. The version aims to improve efficiency and accuracy in complex task handling.",
